  "instructions": [
    "Combine the rice, water, and 1/2 tsp salt in a medium pot. Bring to a boil, cover, and cook on low for 15 minutes until the water is absorbed and the rice is tender.",
    "Pat the tofu cubes dry and toss them with 3 tbsp cornstarch in a bowl until coated.",
    "Drain the pineapple juice into a small bowl, keeping the chunks aside. Whisk in the ketchup, vinegar, brown sugar, soy sauce, and 1 tsp cornstarch until smooth.",
    "Heat the oil in a 12 inch nonstick skillet over medium-high heat. Add the tofu in one layer and cook 8 minutes, turning, until golden and crisp on most sides.",
    "Move the tofu to a plate. Add the bell peppers to the skillet and cook 3 minutes until bright and just tender.",
    "Stir the sauce and pour it into the skillet. Simmer 2 minutes until it thickens and coats a spoon.",
    "Add the tofu and pineapple chunks. Stir gently for 1 minute until hot, then serve over the rice."
  ],
